# Dathon draws for both enchantment casts, deals 2 only for the Saga spell, and adds a lore counter to the Saga (CR 601.2i,
# 603.2, 122.1).
# Dathon, His Heart Open {G}{U}{R}: Legendary Creature — Tamarian Officer
#   Whenever you cast an enchantment spell, draw a card. If it's a Saga spell, Dathon deals 2 damage to each opponent.
